<li>Click "Services" in the left menu.</li>
<li>Add each service you offer with a description of 300-1,000 characters.</li>
<li>Include pricing if possible (even a range like "$150-$300").</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Service description formula:</strong></p>
<div class="code-block">
<pre><code>[Service name] in [primary city] and surrounding areas. Our [trade] technicians 
are licensed, insured, and experienced in [specific details]. We offer 
[benefit: same-day service, 24/7 availability, free estimates]. 
Call [phone] to schedule.
</code></pre>
</div>
<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>"Emergency Drain Cleaning in Dallas and surrounding areas. Our licensed plumbers use professional-grade equipment to clear clogged drains, sewer lines, and grease traps. We offer same-day service and 24/7 emergency response. Call (214) 555-0199 to schedule."</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Add 10-20 services</strong> covering every offering you have. The more services you list, the more search queries your profile can match.</p>
