<p><strong>The contractor-specific review advantage:</strong> Home service businesses consistently earn the highest average ratings on Google compared to other industries. HVAC companies average 4.55 stars, plumbers average 4.52 stars, and electricians average 4.50 stars, according to ReplyOnTheFly's 2026 industry benchmarks. Homeowners appreciate contractors who show up on time, solve their problem, and leave their home clean. The bar for a five-star review in home services is surprisingly achievable.</p>
<h3>Review Generation Scripts</h3>
<p>The #1 reason contractors do not have enough reviews is simple: they do not ask. Most satisfied customers will leave a review if you make it easy. Here are the exact scripts that work.</p>
<p><strong>Script 1: In-person ask (most effective)</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>"[Customer name], I'm so glad we could get your [problem] fixed today. If you have 30 seconds, would you mind leaving us a quick review on Google? It really helps other homeowners in [city] find us. I can send you a link by text right now."</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Script 2: Text message follow-up (sent 2-4 hours after job completion)</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>"Hi [Name], this is [Your name] from [Business]. Thanks again for choosing us for your [service] today. If you were happy with our work, would you mind leaving a quick Google review? It takes 30 seconds and helps us a ton. [short link]"</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Script 3: Email follow-up (sent 24 hours after service)</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>Subject: How did we do with your [service]?</p>
<p>Hi [Name],</p>
<p>I hope your [service] is working perfectly. We enjoyed working with you in [neighborhood].</p>
<p>If you have a moment, would you leave us a review on Google? Your feedback helps other homeowners in [city] make confident decisions.</p>
<p>[Review link button]</p>
<p>Thank you,<br />
[Your name]<br />
[Business name]</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Script 4: Invoice/receipt insert</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>"We hope you were 100% satisfied with your service today. If so, we'd be grateful for a quick Google review. Scan the QR code or visit [link]. Thank you for supporting local business!"</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Script 5: Post-service card (left on counter or mailed)</strong></p>
<blockquote class="highlight-quote">
<p>"Your opinion matters! Help other [city] homeowners find trusted [trade] services. Leave your review at [link] or scan the QR code. As a thank you, enjoy 10% off your next service."</p>
</blockquote>
