<h3>ROI Measurement</h3>
<p>Local SEO ROI is measured in leads and revenue, not rankings.</p>
<p><strong>The local SEO ROI formula:</strong></p>
<div class="code-block">
<pre><code>Monthly Local SEO Investment = $X
Monthly Leads from Local SEO = Y
Cost Per Lead = $X / Y
Lead-to-Customer Conversion Rate = Z%
New Customers from Local SEO = Y * Z%
Average Customer Value = $A
Monthly Revenue from Local SEO = (Y * Z%) * $A
ROI = (Revenue - Investment) / Investment * 100
</code></pre>
</div>
<p><strong>Example ROI calculation:</strong></p>
<div class="cost-table">
<table>
<thead>
